---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Polis Interface">
  <section class="hero stack">
    <p class="badge">Local v1 civic graph</p>
    <h1>Polis Interface</h1>
    <p>
      Local civic infrastructure for source-linked governance maps, public audit trails, and proof-oriented transition pilots.
      Current build: seeded Postgres graph, public BFF, internal graph API, append-only audit service, and Astro app shells.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/governance/jur-croatia-local">Enter the governance map</a> · <a href="/audit">Read the public audit trail</a> · <a href="/issues">Browse issues</a>
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="grid" aria-label="Public interface pillars">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Map</h2>
      <p class="muted">Follow jurisdiction → institution → role → process without losing confidence or review state.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Evidence</h2>
      <p class="muted">Claims show source links when supported, or an explicit unsupported draft badge when not.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Audit</h2>
      <p class="muted">Public, redacted audit events expose actors, actions, hashes, and previous hashes.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Pilot</h2>
      <p class="muted">Live municipal pilot with Grad Primjer. <a href="/partners">Charter</a> · <a href="/pilot/results">Results</a></p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>
